      "message": "This class is public API of apksig library. Thus, please don\u0027t remove existing methods/constructors (at least not without deprecating them for a number of releases first). apksig is following Android framework public API guidelines. In particular, Builders\u0027 constructors must take only mandatory arguments whereas optional tweaks/settings should be provided via setters. Given that maxSdkVersion is not a mandatory parameter for DefaultApkSignerEngine (but minSdkVersion is), I\u0027d suggest not touching constructors and instead adding a setMaxSdkVersion method.",
